1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Aiden, meet Rose at Black Hollow.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,000
I gave Aiden the key.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,000
Rose didn't say we could go.

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,000
There's a rose by the north window.

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,000
Maybe Black Hollow isn't safe.

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,000
Tell Aiden: three keys, not thirteen.

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,000
She said, "Leave it there."

8
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,000
If only I had—
